# Security Reports

Generated by: make code-security, make ci

## Output Files

| File       | Description                  |
|------------|------------------------------|
| bandit.txt | Bandit security scan results |

## Configuration

File: pyproject.toml

| Section        | Purpose                              |
|----------------|--------------------------------------|
| [tool.bandit]  | Targets, excludes, severity levels   |

Key settings:
- targets = ["src"]
- severity = "MEDIUM"
- confidence = "MEDIUM"
